@startuml sequence-rates-update
title Scheduled rate update
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "RateUpdateScheduler" as Sch
database "shedlock" as Lock
participant "ExchangeRateService" as S
participant "ExternalRateProviderClient" as C
participant "External rate API" as Ext
database "DB" as DB

note over Sch: first run right after the start, then every hour;\nthe 1 h schedule and the 3 h rate lifetime come from application.yml
note over DB: currencies, rate_providers and rate_corrections are filled by Flyway migrations; there is no API that changes them
Sch -> Lock: acquire "updateRates" (database time, lockAtMostFor)
alt lock is held by another instance
    Lock --> Sch: skip this run
else lock acquired
    Sch -> S: updateRates()
    S -> DB: active providers by priority, active currencies, active rate_corrections
    loop providers in priority order, until one answers valid data
        S -> C: fetchRates(provider)
        C -> Ext: GET latest rates against one base currency (timeout, retry with backoff)
        note right of Ext: valid = every active currency present, every rate > 0
    end
    alt every provider fails or answers invalid data
        S -> S: log ERROR, metric update failed
        note right: nothing is written, the old rates stay valid until their rate_end_time
    else rates received
        S -> S: every pair A→B of active currencies:\nrate = base rate of B / base rate of A × coefficient from rate_corrections (1 if no active one);\nthe base currency of the answer has base rate 1
        group one DB transaction
            S -> DB: INSERT conversion_rates: begin = now, end = now + 3 h, provider_code
            alt DB error
                S -> DB: ROLLBACK
                S -> S: log ERROR, metric update failed
                note right: nothing is written, the old rates stay valid
            else
                S -> DB: COMMIT
                S -> S: log INFO, metric update succeeded + duration
            end
        end
    end
    Sch -> Lock: release (held at least lockAtLeastFor)
end
@enduml
